# Vercel CLI uploads (dashboard Git imports ignore this file).
# Never upload local env files: web/.env.local would bake localhost URLs and the Privy app id
# into the hosted demo build. Hosted values come from the Vercel project's env settings.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
docs
contracts/lib
contracts/out
contracts/cache
**/.state.json
**/.buyer-run.lock
